' UI-42 in the intro and on the start screen it leads to: the window resized
' and switched to fullscreen and back while the intro plays, then a click
' to the start screen and its NOTES button clicked at the smallest size that
' shows the whole interface (600 x 449, a 320 x 200 game). Run with `menu
' seed 7 window 640x480`, as it is and with `newgfx off`. `menuclick` is made
' a window pixel in the window as it is when the step is taken.
wait 186
snap intro_640            ' page 0, map 89, centred in 341 x 213
resize 1280x720           ' 1.5x: 455 x 213
wait 3
snap intro_1280
resize 600x449            ' the computed minimum: exactly 320 x 200
wait 3
snap intro_600
f11                       ' fullscreen at the desktop's size
wait 3
snap intro_full
f11                       ' back to the size the window opened at
wait 3
snap intro_back
resize 1920x1080          ' 2x: 512 x 240, the intro going on
wait 437
snap intro_1920_ani       ' intro1.ani, laid out in the wider game
menuclick 160,100         ' any click: the start screen
wait 30
snap menu_1920
resize 600x449
wait 3
snap menu_600
menuclick 12,163          ' a pixel left of NOTES (13,163 36x18): nothing
wait 3
snap menu_600_beside
menuclick 13,163          ' NOTES' first pixel: the notes open
wait 3
snap notes_600
press escape
wait 3
f11
wait 3
snap menu_full
menuclick 48,180          ' NOTES' last pixel, in fullscreen: open
wait 3
snap notes_full
press escape
wait 3
f11
wait 3
snap menu_back
quit
